= The signatures are collected after midnight

Kaczyński's envoys return with a place in cabinet and no promise to soften the
rest of the government. **Włodzimierz Czarzasty** accepts. New Left deputies
will make Morawiecki's majority comfortable again; in return, PiS opens the
social and economic side of the cabinet table to negotiation while reserving
the coercive ministries for itself.

Razem refuses the oath. KO calls the agreement a rescue operation for
Kaczyński, while PiS television discovers a responsible patriotic left for the
first time in its life. Konfederacja is delighted: it can now campaign against
the entire parliamentary settlement at once.

The agreement settles the majority, not the offices. We must now decide which
ministries are worth owning and which PiS decisions we are willing to defend
in exchange for them.

- @poland_ministries: Negotiate the cabinet portfolios

